(Nookly: OAU Student Housing Finder) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Project Report) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Programme: Student Work Experience Programme \(SWEP 200\) Project Title:) Tj
T*
(Nookly: OAU Student Housing Finder Project Type: Functional web-based) Tj
T*
(student housing discovery system Institution Context: Obafemi Awolowo) Tj
T*
(University, Ile-Ife Verification Date Shown In System: 03/10/2026 Live) Tj
T*
(Report Channel: Formspree correction report form) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Abstract) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Nookly is a web-based hostel discovery and comparison system developed) Tj
T*
(for students around Obafemi Awolowo University, Ile-Ife. The project) Tj
T*
(addresses the difficulty students face when comparing hostel names,) Tj
T*
(locations, rent periods, room types, facilities, distance and) Tj
T*
(availability from scattered information sources. The system provides a) Tj
T*
(responsive web interface, verified hostel cards, search and filtering,) Tj
T*
(map-based routing, budget planning, hostel comparison and a correction) Tj
T*
(report form.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The project applies SWEP 200 concepts including Web Technology,) Tj
T*
(Networking, Product Design, Data Analysis, Python-based data) Tj
T*
(preparation and basic Cyber Security awareness. The final version) Tj
T*
(contains 48 hostel records, including on-campus and off-campus) Tj
T*
(options. On-campus hostels use the Hezekiah Oluwasanmi Library as a) Tj
T*
(reference point, while off-campus hostels use OAU Main Gate. Reports) Tj
T*
(are submitted through Formspree, and the map uses Leaflet,) Tj
T*
(OpenStreetMap tiles and OSRM routing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Introduction) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Accommodation is a practical challenge for many university students.) Tj
T*
(Around OAU, students often depend on word-of-mouth, social media) Tj
T*
(posts, map searches and informal contacts to locate hostels. This) Tj
T*
(makes comparison slow, inconsistent and sometimes confusing. Students) Tj
T*
(may know a hostel name but not its approximate location, rent period,) Tj
T*
(room type or route from campus.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Nookly was designed as a functional web-based solution for discovering) Tj
T*
(and comparing student housing around OAU. It is not a booking) Tj
T*
(platform. Instead, it helps students make a better first comparison) Tj
T*
(before physically visiting or contacting a hostel.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Problem Statement) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
