T*
(Students around OAU face these problems:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Hostel information is scattered across conversations, websites, map) Tj
T*
(listings and reviews.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- On-campus and off-campus accommodation details are not presented) Tj
T*
(together.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Rent periods are unclear; on-campus accommodation is per session,) Tj
T*
(while off-campus rent is usually yearly.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Distance and route context are difficult to compare quickly.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Students need a way to report wrong or outdated information.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Many existing solutions are only static pages and do not provide) Tj
T*
(useful filtering, comparison or route context.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
