T*
() Tj
T*
(The aim of this project is to build a functional web-based hostel) Tj
T*
(finder that helps OAU students discover and compare accommodation) Tj
T*
(options.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The objectives are:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Build a responsive website using HTML, CSS and JavaScript.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Store hostel information in structured JSON data.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Provide search, filter and sorting features for hostel discovery.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Show hostel locations and route context on an interactive map.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Separate on-campus and off-campus reference points.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Provide budget and comparison tools.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Allow users to submit correction reports.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Document the system clearly for defence and future maintenance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Target Users) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
