(10. Security, Usability And Accessibility) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Security awareness includes:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Escaping dynamic text before inserting it into HTML.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Restricting external links to safe HTTPS URLs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Avoiding secret API keys in the frontend.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Using Formspree for report delivery instead of writing a custom) Tj
T*
(insecure backend.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Keeping unknown data hidden rather than inventing claims.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Usability and accessibility considerations include:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Mobile-first navigation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Labels for form controls.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Clear empty states.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Status messages for filters, reports and routes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Responsive card layout.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Map reset and route controls.) Tj
T*
() Tj
