(12. Challenges And Solutions) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( Challenge  |  Solution) Tj
T*
( Google Maps API cost and billing concerns  |  Used Leaflet,) Tj
T*
(OpenStreetMap and OSRM instead) Tj
T*
( Mobile users having to scroll too much  |  Redesigned architecture) Tj
T*
(into Home, Map, Hostels, Filters and Planner views) Tj
T*
( Duplicate-looking addresses  |  Cleaned location display so cards) Tj
T*
(show one professional location line) Tj
T*
( Unknown hostel details  |  Kept unknown values hidden or marked as) Tj
T*
(unavailable instead of guessing) Tj
T*
( Report delivery  |  Connected the report form to Formspree) Tj
T*
( Route clutter on the map  |  Routes are controlled and selected) Tj
T*
(routes are highlighted) Tj
T*
( Data freshness  |  Added visible verification date and report) Tj
T*
(correction workflow) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(13. Limitations) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- The project is not a booking/payment platform.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Availability can change after the verification date.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Driving estimates do not include live traffic.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- OSRM routes depend on available OpenStreetMap road data.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- A verified listing does not guarantee vacancy or safety.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
